[
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00001",
    "start_seconds": 0.0,
    "end_seconds": 5.32,
    "text": "The way we find papers in 2026 looks"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00002",
    "start_seconds": 2.8,
    "end_seconds": 7.16,
    "text": "nothing like it did 5 years ago. You're"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00003",
    "start_seconds": 5.32,
    "end_seconds": 9.92,
    "text": "using AI assistants to summarize"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00004",
    "start_seconds": 7.16,
    "end_seconds": 12.84,
    "text": "literature, visual tools to map citation"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00005",
    "start_seconds": 9.92,
    "end_seconds": 15.24,
    "text": "networks, and discovery apps to follow"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00006",
    "start_seconds": 12.84,
    "end_seconds": 17.4,
    "text": "references. And that's on top of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00007",
    "start_seconds": 15.24,
    "end_seconds": 20.24,
    "text": "traditional sources like your university"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00008",
    "start_seconds": 17.4,
    "end_seconds": 22.8,
    "text": "library and Google Scholar. The"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00009",
    "start_seconds": 20.24,
    "end_seconds": 25.44,
    "text": "challenge is keeping all of this in one"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00010",
    "start_seconds": 22.8,
    "end_seconds": 28.28,
    "text": "place and then actually organizing it"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00011",
    "start_seconds": 25.44,
    "end_seconds": 30.64,
    "text": "and making sure it gets read. So, let me"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00012",
    "start_seconds": 28.28,
    "end_seconds": 33.28,
    "text": "show you how Paperpile brings it all"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00013",
    "start_seconds": 30.64,
    "end_seconds": 33.28,
    "text": "together."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00014",
    "start_seconds": 35.28,
    "end_seconds": 39.88,
    "text": "Let's start with the basics. Google"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00015",
    "start_seconds": 37.4,
    "end_seconds": 41.04,
    "text": "Scholar and PubMed aren't going"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00016",
    "start_seconds": 39.88,
    "end_seconds": 43.6,
    "text": "anywhere."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00017",
    "start_seconds": 41.04,
    "end_seconds": 46.36,
    "text": "So, let's say I'm starting research on"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00018",
    "start_seconds": 43.6,
    "end_seconds": 49.04,
    "text": "bee population decline. I'll run a broad"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00019",
    "start_seconds": 46.36,
    "end_seconds": 50.88,
    "text": "search in Google Scholar. Now, I've got"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00020",
    "start_seconds": 49.04,
    "end_seconds": 52.64,
    "text": "a list of results."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00021",
    "start_seconds": 50.88,
    "end_seconds": 55.8,
    "text": "This is usually the point where things"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00022",
    "start_seconds": 52.64,
    "end_seconds": 58.76,
    "text": "start to get messy. I'll open a few"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00023",
    "start_seconds": 55.8,
    "end_seconds": 61.36,
    "text": "tabs, maybe download a couple of PDFs,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00024",
    "start_seconds": 58.76,
    "end_seconds": 63.92,
    "text": "bookmark a few papers, and then promise"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00025",
    "start_seconds": 61.36,
    "end_seconds": 66.04,
    "text": "myself I'll sort it later."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00026",
    "start_seconds": 63.92,
    "end_seconds": 69.6,
    "text": "With the Paperpile browser extension, I"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00027",
    "start_seconds": 66.04,
    "end_seconds": 72.48,
    "text": "can save as I go instead. You'll see the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00028",
    "start_seconds": 69.6,
    "end_seconds": 75.56,
    "text": "Paperpile buttons next to every result"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00029",
    "start_seconds": 72.48,
    "end_seconds": 79.04,
    "text": "to Google Scholar, PubMed, archive,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00030",
    "start_seconds": 75.56,
    "end_seconds": 81.6,
    "text": "hundreds of academic databases."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00031",
    "start_seconds": 79.04,
    "end_seconds": 83.84,
    "text": "If I hover over a result, I can click"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00032",
    "start_seconds": 81.6,
    "end_seconds": 85.36,
    "text": "the Paperpile button to add it to my"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00033",
    "start_seconds": 83.84,
    "end_seconds": 87.32,
    "text": "library."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00034",
    "start_seconds": 85.36,
    "end_seconds": 89.76,
    "text": "That pulls in the full reference"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00035",
    "start_seconds": 87.32,
    "end_seconds": 93.12,
    "text": "automatically. That's title, authors,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00036",
    "start_seconds": 89.76,
    "end_seconds": 95.72,
    "text": "journal, year, DOI, everything."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00037",
    "start_seconds": 93.12,
    "end_seconds": 98.24,
    "text": "Paperpile will also look for the PDF at"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00038",
    "start_seconds": 95.72,
    "end_seconds": 100.6,
    "text": "the same time."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00039",
    "start_seconds": 98.24,
    "end_seconds": 103.72,
    "text": "If I find a few useful ones, I can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00040",
    "start_seconds": 100.6,
    "end_seconds": 106.0,
    "text": "select several and add them together."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00041",
    "start_seconds": 103.72,
    "end_seconds": 108.2,
    "text": "Then I can put them in a folder, add a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00042",
    "start_seconds": 106.0,
    "end_seconds": 111.96,
    "text": "label, or leave a note if I want to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00043",
    "start_seconds": 108.2,
    "end_seconds": 111.96,
    "text": "remember why I saved them."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00044",
    "start_seconds": 113.76,
    "end_seconds": 121.2,
    "text": "So, before I move on, everything is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00045",
    "start_seconds": 116.12,
    "end_seconds": 121.2,
    "text": "already organized with no cleanup later."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00046",
    "start_seconds": 127.92,
    "end_seconds": 132.76,
    "text": "Now let's talk about the new generation"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00047",
    "start_seconds": 130.0,
    "end_seconds": 135.4,
    "text": "of tools, AI-powered search engines"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00048",
    "start_seconds": 132.76,
    "end_seconds": 138.48,
    "text": "built specifically for research. But the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00049",
    "start_seconds": 135.4,
    "end_seconds": 141.2,
    "text": "pattern here is simple. Ask a question,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00050",
    "start_seconds": 138.48,
    "end_seconds": 143.44,
    "text": "get AI-generated summaries, and save"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00051",
    "start_seconds": 141.2,
    "end_seconds": 146.12,
    "text": "what's relevant, all without leaving the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00052",
    "start_seconds": 143.44,
    "end_seconds": 149.2,
    "text": "search page. Let me show you how that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00053",
    "start_seconds": 146.12,
    "end_seconds": 152.32,
    "text": "works. Instead of a keyword, I start"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00054",
    "start_seconds": 149.2,
    "end_seconds": 155.52,
    "text": "with a question, something like, \"What's"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00055",
    "start_seconds": 152.32,
    "end_seconds": 157.52,
    "text": "driving bee population decline?\""
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00056",
    "start_seconds": 155.52,
    "end_seconds": 160.4,
    "text": "Tools like Consensus and Google Scholar"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00057",
    "start_seconds": 157.52,
    "end_seconds": 163.24,
    "text": "Labs return papers with AI-generated"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00058",
    "start_seconds": 160.4,
    "end_seconds": 165.52,
    "text": "summaries right in the results. I'll"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00059",
    "start_seconds": 163.24,
    "end_seconds": 167.04,
    "text": "scroll through, click the Paperpile"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00060",
    "start_seconds": 165.52,
    "end_seconds": 169.68,
    "text": "button next to anything that looks"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00061",
    "start_seconds": 167.04,
    "end_seconds": 172.4,
    "text": "relevant, and it's added to my library"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00062",
    "start_seconds": 169.68,
    "end_seconds": 175.24,
    "text": "instantly. If I'm using Scholar Labs,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00063",
    "start_seconds": 172.4,
    "end_seconds": 179.52,
    "text": "the AI summary can be imported as a note"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00064",
    "start_seconds": 175.24,
    "end_seconds": 179.52,
    "text": "as well, which is useful later."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00065",
    "start_seconds": 183.16,
    "end_seconds": 189.239,
    "text": "Once I've found a few references, I'll"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00066",
    "start_seconds": 185.68,
    "end_seconds": 191.6,
    "text": "actually use those to find more. The"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00067",
    "start_seconds": 189.239,
    "end_seconds": 193.92,
    "text": "simplest way is to check what sites a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00068",
    "start_seconds": 191.6,
    "end_seconds": 196.4,
    "text": "paper in Google Scholar,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00069",
    "start_seconds": 193.92,
    "end_seconds": 199.239,
    "text": "but the most powerful discovery happens"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00070",
    "start_seconds": 196.4,
    "end_seconds": 201.959,
    "text": "through visual tools that map citation"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00071",
    "start_seconds": 199.239,
    "end_seconds": 203.92,
    "text": "networks. Tools like Connected Papers,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00072",
    "start_seconds": 201.959,
    "end_seconds": 206.08,
    "text": "Litmaps, and Research Rabbit that"
