  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00073",
    "start_seconds": 203.92,
    "end_seconds": 208.04,
    "text": "specialize in doing this."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00074",
    "start_seconds": 206.08,
    "end_seconds": 210.12,
    "text": "Connected Papers shows you a visual"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00075",
    "start_seconds": 208.04,
    "end_seconds": 211.959,
    "text": "graph of papers related to one you"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00076",
    "start_seconds": 210.12,
    "end_seconds": 214.68,
    "text": "already have."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00077",
    "start_seconds": 211.959,
    "end_seconds": 217.04,
    "text": "Click any paper in the graph,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00078",
    "start_seconds": 214.68,
    "end_seconds": 218.92,
    "text": "and the Paperpile button is there, which"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00079",
    "start_seconds": 217.04,
    "end_seconds": 221.92,
    "text": "you can add without leaving the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00080",
    "start_seconds": 218.92,
    "end_seconds": 221.92,
    "text": "visualization."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00081",
    "start_seconds": 222.68,
    "end_seconds": 228.0,
    "text": "Litmaps builds literature maps showing"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00082",
    "start_seconds": 225.08,
    "end_seconds": 230.04,
    "text": "connections between papers. Paperpile"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00083",
    "start_seconds": 228.0,
    "end_seconds": 234.44,
    "text": "buttons appear throughout, so you can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00084",
    "start_seconds": 230.04,
    "end_seconds": 234.44,
    "text": "build your library as you explore."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00085",
    "start_seconds": 237.28,
    "end_seconds": 241.72,
    "text": "Research Rabbit suggests related work"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00086",
    "start_seconds": 239.56,
    "end_seconds": 244.48,
    "text": "either from keyword search or by"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00087",
    "start_seconds": 241.72,
    "end_seconds": 247.2,
    "text": "importing papers that you already know."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00088",
    "start_seconds": 244.48,
    "end_seconds": 249.16,
    "text": "And it's the same pattern. When I see"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00089",
    "start_seconds": 247.2,
    "end_seconds": 251.84,
    "text": "something useful, I add it to my"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00090",
    "start_seconds": 249.16,
    "end_seconds": 251.84,
    "text": "library."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00091",
    "start_seconds": 253.72,
    "end_seconds": 258.04,
    "text": "These tools surface papers you wouldn't"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00092",
    "start_seconds": 255.8,
    "end_seconds": 260.959,
    "text": "otherwise find through keyword search"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00093",
    "start_seconds": 258.04,
    "end_seconds": 263.52,
    "text": "alone. With Paperpile, you can make sure"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00094",
    "start_seconds": 260.959,
    "end_seconds": 265.16,
    "text": "everything gets saved as you go. And of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00095",
    "start_seconds": 263.52,
    "end_seconds": 267.28,
    "text": "course, if you're working with a larger"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00096",
    "start_seconds": 265.16,
    "end_seconds": 269.32,
    "text": "set, you can export a collection of"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00097",
    "start_seconds": 267.28,
    "end_seconds": 273.72,
    "text": "papers from any of these tools and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00098",
    "start_seconds": 269.32,
    "end_seconds": 273.72,
    "text": "import it into Paperpile in one go."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00099",
    "start_seconds": 277.4,
    "end_seconds": 282.84,
    "text": "Research in 2026 means jumping between"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00100",
    "start_seconds": 280.2,
    "end_seconds": 285.48,
    "text": "traditional databases, AI-powered search"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00101",
    "start_seconds": 282.84,
    "end_seconds": 288.12,
    "text": "engines, and citation network tools."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00102",
    "start_seconds": 285.48,
    "end_seconds": 290.28,
    "text": "Now, Paperpile brings it all together."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00103",
    "start_seconds": 288.12,
    "end_seconds": 293.08,
    "text": "Wherever you find papers, they end up in"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00104",
    "start_seconds": 290.28,
    "end_seconds": 296.72,
    "text": "one organized library, ready to read,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-00105",
    "start_seconds": 293.08,
    "end_seconds": 296.72,
    "text": "annotate, and cite."
  }
]
